description: Route explicit Orchestration skill installation and updates to the shared procedure.
alwaysApply: false
---

For an explicit request to install or update Orchestration skills, follow `docs/guides/agent-installation.md`. In Cursor, install the six checked-in user-facing folders into `~/.cursor/skills/` or an established compatible custom skill location.

Do not apply this rule to ordinary code-editing requests.
